<title>USA: Cooper Cos stake cut by Cooper Life.</title>
<headline>Cooper Cos stake cut by Cooper Life.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Life Sciences Inc said Friday it cut its stake in Cooper Cos Inc to 1,567,533 common shares or 13.42 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cooper Life said it sold 165,000 common shares between February 5 and February 19 at prices ranging from $20 to $21.50 per share.</p>
